<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>예산 계획 설정</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/main.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        .budget-container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 32px 24px 48px;
        }

        .budget-card {
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 36px;
            margin-top: 36px;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            border-left: 6px solid #4a90e2;
        }

        .settings-panel {
            background-color: #f4f8ff;
            border-left-color: #4a90e2;
        }

        .budget-card h4 {
            color: #262626;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 26px;
            font-size: 1.75rem;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .form-group label {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #2f3b4a;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            display: block;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .form-control {
            padding: 14px 16px;
            border: 1px solid #d0dae6;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
 
        .form-control:focus {
            border-color: #4a90e2;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 0.2rem rgba(74, 144, 226, 0.25);
        }

        .budget-display {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4a90e2 0%, #5b9bd5 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 28px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .budget-label {
            font-size: 14px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .budget-amount {
            font-size: 44px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-top: 12px;
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        }

        .nav-tabs {
            border-bottom: 2px solid #dee2e6;
        }

        .nav-tabs .nav-link {
            color: #4a90e2;
            border: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            border-bottom: 3px solid transparent;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-tabs .nav-link:hover {
            color: #4a90e2;
            border-bottom-color: #4a90e2;
        }
 
        .nav-tabs .nav-link.active {
            color: #4a90e2;
            border-bottom-color: #4a90e2;
            background-color: transparent;
        }

        .btn-save {
            background-color: #4a90e2;
            border-color: #4a90e2;
            color: white;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 16px 28px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            width: auto;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(74, 144, 226, 0.18);
        }

        .btn-save.btn-sm {
            padding: 10px 18px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            box-shadow: none;
        }
  
        /* small circular icon button used for inline "설정하기" */
        .btn-icon {
            padding: 10px;
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1;
            border-width: 1.4px;
        }
        .btn-icon.btn-center {
            display: flex;
            margin: 18px auto 0;
        }
        .btn-icon svg {
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
        }

        .btn-save:hover {
            background-color: #3a78c2;
            border-color: #3a78c2;
            color: white;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .alert-message {
            display: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            animation: slideIn 0.3s ease;
        }

        @keyframes slideIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(-10px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .alert-success {
            background-color: #d4edda;
            color: #155724;
            border: 1px solid #c3e6cb;
        }

        .alert-danger {
            background-color: #f8d7da;
            color: #721c24;
            border: 1px solid #f5c6cb;
        }
 
        .summary-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
 
        .summary-item {
            position: relative;
            background-color: #f4f8ff;
            border: 1px solid #d9e7ff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 26px;
            min-height: 220px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .summary-item .actions {
            position: absolute;
            top: 12px;
            right: 12px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.18s ease;
        }

        .summary-item:hover .actions {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        /* when we want the action to always be visible (e.g., + for empty cards) */
        .actions.always-visible {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .btn-icon.top-right {
            width: 38px;
            height: 38px;
            padding: 6px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .actions .btn {
            padding: 6px 8px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .actions .btn-delete:hover {
            background-color: #ffeded;
            border-color: #ff6b6b;
            color: #c12b2b;
        }
 
        .summary-label {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #5f6b7b;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .summary-value {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #202633;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
 
        .summary-subtext {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #4e5d6b;
        }
 
        .summary-chip {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            background-color: #eaf3ff;
            color: #185abc;
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }
 
        .helper-text {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #6c757d;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .budget-card {
                padding: 20px;
            }

            .budget-amount {
                font-size: 28px;
            }

            .nav-tabs .nav-link {
                padding: 10px 16px;
                font-size: 14px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-light">
    <%- include('nav.ejs') %>

    <% const budgetInfo = (typeof locals !== 'undefined' && typeof locals.budgetData !== 'undefined') ? locals.budgetData : {
        monthlyAmount: null,
        monthlyPeriod: '',
        monthlyUsedAmount: 0,
        annualAmount: null,
        annualPeriod: '',
        annualUsedAmount: 0
    }; %>
    <% const hasMonthlyBudget = budgetInfo && budgetInfo.monthlyAmount != null; %>
    <% const hasAnnualBudget = budgetInfo && budgetInfo.annualAmount != null; %>
    <% const hasBudget = hasMonthlyBudget || hasAnnualBudget; %>
    <% const monthlyUsedAmount = budgetInfo.monthlyUsedAmount != null ? budgetInfo.monthlyUsedAmount : (hasMonthlyBudget ? Math.max(0, Math.floor(budgetInfo.monthlyAmount * 0.35)) : 0); %>
    <% const monthlyRemaining = hasMonthlyBudget ? Math.max(0, budgetInfo.monthlyAmount - monthlyUsedAmount) : 0; %>
    <% const annualUsedAmount = budgetInfo.annualUsedAmount != null ? budgetInfo.annualUsedAmount : (hasAnnualBudget ? Math.max(0, Math.floor(budgetInfo.annualAmount * 0.28)) : 0); %>
    <% const annualRemaining = hasAnnualBudget ? Math.max(0, budgetInfo.annualAmount - annualUsedAmount) : 0; %>

    <div class="budget-container">
        <h2 style="color: #1f2937; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 2.2rem;">📊 예산 계획</h2>
        <p style="color: #55606e; margin-bottom: 26px; font-size: 1rem;">월간 · 연간 예산과 사용 예산을 한눈에 확인할 수 있는 넓은 대시보드 화면입니다.</p>

        <div class="alert-message" id="messageBox"></div>

        <!-- 예산 개요 화면 -->
        <div class="budget-card" id="overviewPanel">
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start gap-3 flex-wrap mb-4">
                <div>
                    <h4>예산 개요</h4>
                    <p class="helper-text mb-0">월간 · 연간 예산과 지금까지 사용한 금액을 함께 확인할 수 있는 화면입니다.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <% if (hasBudget) { %>
                <div class="summary-row">
                    <div class="summary-item" id="monthlyCard">
                        <div class="actions <%= hasMonthlyBudget ? '' : 'always-visible' %>">
                            <% if (hasMonthlyBudget) { %>
                                <a href="/budget/plan?tab=monthly" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm">수정</a>
                                <form action="/plan/budget/delete" method="POST" style="display:inline;">
                                    <input type="hidden" name="planType" value="monthly">
                                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm btn-delete">삭제</button>
                                </form>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <a href="/budget/plan?tab=monthly" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm btn-icon top-right" title="예산 설정하기" aria-label="예산 설정하기">
                                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
                                </a>
                            <% } %>
                        </div>

                        <div class="summary-label">월간 예산</div>
                        <% if (hasMonthlyBudget) { %>
                            <div class="summary-value">₩<%= Number(budgetInfo.monthlyAmount).toLocaleString() %></div>
                            
                            <div class="summary-label" style="margin-top: 20px;">지금까지 사용한 금액</div>
                            <div class="summary-value">₩<%= Number(monthlyUsedAmount).toLocaleString() %></div>
                            <div class="summary-chip">남은 예산 ₩<%= Number(monthlyRemaining).toLocaleString() %></div>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <p class="helper-text">아직 월간 예산이 설정되어 있지 않습니다.</p>
                        <% } %>
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-item" id="annualCard">
                        <div class="actions <%= hasAnnualBudget ? '' : 'always-visible' %>">
                            <% if (hasAnnualBudget) { %>
                                <a href="/budget/plan?tab=annual" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm">수정</a>
                                <form action="/plan/budget/delete" method="POST" style="display:inline;">
                                    <input type="hidden" name="planType" value="annual">
                                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm btn-delete">삭제</button>
                                </form>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <a href="/budget/plan?tab=annual" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm btn-icon top-right" title="예산 설정하기" aria-label="예산 설정하기">
                                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
                                </a>
                            <% } %>
                        </div>

                        <div class="summary-label">연간 예산</div>
                        <% if (hasAnnualBudget) { %>
                            <div class="summary-value">₩<%= Number(budgetInfo.annualAmount).toLocaleString() %></div>
                            
                            <div class="summary-label" style="margin-top: 20px;">지금까지 사용한 금액</div>
                            <div class="summary-value">₩<%= Number(annualUsedAmount).toLocaleString() %></div>
                            <div class="summary-chip">남은 예산 ₩<%= Number(annualRemaining).toLocaleString() %></div>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <p class="helper-text">아직 연간 예산이 설정되어 있지 않습니다.</p>
                        <% } %>
                    </div>
                </div>
            <% } else { %>
                <div class="summary-row">
                    <div class="summary-item">
                        <div class="actions always-visible">
                            <a href="/budget/plan?tab=monthly" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm btn-icon top-right" title="예산 설정하기" aria-label="예산 설정하기">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="summary-label">월간 예산</div>
                        <div class="summary-value">-</div>
                        <p class="helper-text">월간 예산이 아직 설정되지 않았습니다.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="summary-item">
                        <div class="actions always-visible">
                            <a href="/budget/plan?tab=annual" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm btn-icon top-right" title="예산 설정하기" aria-label="예산 설정하기">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="summary-label">연간 예산</div>
                        <div class="summary-value">-</div>
                        <p class="helper-text">연간 예산이 아직 설정되지 않았습니다.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            <% } %>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>